  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "eyebrow": "Campaign",
      "title": "VeHolachta Bidrochov → Squad Drills",
      "text": "A four-week cycle that builds one middah, framed as a battle and modelled on a tzaddik couple."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "html": "<b>Where your platoon is</b>Cycle: Avraham &amp; Sara · Middah: Selfish vs. Generous · Week 2 of 4. The site serves the piece for the week you are in, so nobody has to work out where the cycle stands."
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"drill\"><div class=\"dw\" style=\"--c:var(--red)\"><div class=\"wk\">Week 1</div><b>Recon Mission</b><div class=\"kd\">the red comic</div><p>Expose the enemy — how the Yetzer Hara tricks you into the bad middah. Think, feel, act.</p></div><div class=\"dw now\" style=\"--c:var(--gold)\"><div class=\"wk\">Week 2</div><b>The Article</b><div class=\"kd\">read together</div><p>Learn a different way from the couple — “Avraham's Way.”</p></div><div class=\"dw\" style=\"--c:var(--gold)\"><div class=\"wk\">Week 3</div><b>Attack</b><div class=\"kd\">the yellow comic</div><p>Put on their glasses and apply the strategy — the Yetzer Tov's think, feel, act.</p></div><div class=\"dw\" style=\"--c:var(--green)\"><div class=\"wk\">Week 4</div><b>Squad Goals</b><div class=\"kd\">report back</div><p>The squad reports back and evaluates the battle. Then the next couple begins.</p></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin-top:20px;color:var(--muted)\">The cycles rotate through the couples: Avraham &amp; Sara · Yitzchak &amp; Rivka · Dovid &amp; Rachel · Yaakov &amp; Leah.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "label",
      "text": "Squad Drills in the library — one per week",
      "spaced": true
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "html": "Real drills from Hachayol #660–681. Machine-read from the scans — proofread before print."
    },
